{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16318060","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16318060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1631806001:1":{"text":"まさか……校長先生が幽霊になって、生徒を脅かすなんてことないですよね！？","source_cn":"不会吧……哪儿有校长变成幽灵后吓唬学生的啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D508783954052DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631806002:1":{"text":"でも、レイモン校長ならやりかねない気もするし……","source_cn":"但如果是雷蒙校长的话，好像不是不可能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F0B04E35C9522B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631806003:1":{"text":"たしかに君の言うとおり、レイモン校長ならやりかねないな。","source_cn":"你说得对，如果是雷蒙那家伙，哪怕变成幽灵也会到处吓人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62BBBA655826684A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631806004:1":{"text":"だが、心配することはない。君が幽霊を怖がっていると分かって、近寄ってくることはないよ。","source_cn":"不过你也不用太担心，雷蒙知道你害怕幽灵的话，就不会来找你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x666972A4D061998B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631806005:1":{"text":"それに、誰もが幽霊になれるわけじゃないんだ。","source_cn":"更何况，不是谁都能变成幽灵的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63D5C86127D54DA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","d